SC,0009
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1774989770
OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                         G9/17
OL,2,V55555555CN-TRIGGERS: IRAQI
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CDEPORTED FROM BRITAIN
OL,4,T
OL,5, An Iraqi thought to have masterminded
OL,6, an alleged plot to smuggle nuclear
OL,7, triggers to Baghdad has been deported
OL,8, from Britain.
OL,10, Omar Latif, who said he was an official
OL,11, of Iraqi Airways, was escorted aboard
OL,12, a Baghdad-bound jumbo jet at Heathrow
OL,13, by police and immigration officials.
OL,15, Three people, a Lebanese engineer, a
OL,16, man with British-Iraqi citizenship and
OL,17, a French woman, have been charged with
OL,18, trying to smuggle the triggers to Iraq.
OL,20, Latif was arrested by police on
OL,21, Wednesday but no charges were brought.
OL,23,F]DFrom 31-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,497,190,120,250,0,100
PN,49610
SC,0010
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1774989770
OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                        G10/17
OL,2,V55555555CANC POSTPONES TALKS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CWITH S AFRICA GOVT
OL,4,T
OL,5, The ANC has postponed indefinitely
OL,6, talks with the South African government
OL,7, in protest against the police shooting
OL,8, of demonstrators at a black township.
OL,10, It added that the government should
OL,11, take action against the police who were
OL,12, establishing a pattern of "brutality
OL,13, and repression".
OL,15, At least 11 people died after police
OL,16, opened fire in the Sebokeng on Monday.
OL,18, The April 11 talks would have been the
OL,19, first step towards negotiations between
OL,20, the white minority government and the
OL,21, black nationalist movement.
OL,23,F]DFrom 31-03-90 / teletextarchive.com
